hike-izer/summaries/*_photos/

# hike-izer-web: Cloudflare Tunnel credentials - real secrets, generated on
# the M8 by `cloudflared tunnel create`, never tracked. Not currently in use
# (CARD-0088 shipped on Tailscale Funnel instead, see CARD-0094 for the
# deferred switch back to this) - left in place for when that happens.
components/hike-izer-web/cloudflared/
